{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_010_02_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:8a8d82802a3c9aa6d1d2e3a55d2c05f822560214ec420f7fc57e1e69afdd300c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_e:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08d60cf7fed0e8443374ea3b06e3ef8e6e002fc64df80c539c8a0b8626e97b5f",
      "text": "我是西点师东云庄一郎。\n承蒙夸奖，深感荣幸。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_e:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a6f9f23e3dbb6c5580b467e838e86b0374f585314507186e48247108528d9f6",
      "text": "您就是……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_e:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:556db16f65b028da82ae20647d07e80b9cc290ebee5c0ed0c75d7f30cca6e260",
      "text": "那、那个……\n这里的蛋糕，真的每一款都太美味了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_e:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afe6c56541052ae4a5a7a1b4c36beec22a7af26395ca1d717c280b0117c7b17c",
      "text": "每一款都有着艺术般的风味，与同样艺术般的外观\n交织成绝妙的和弦……太让我感动了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_e:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1749b2e403ed486913e24bcd3490de927c37efc3a5846c0788bb31b203465499",
      "text": "非常感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_e:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed43b1100c1a28b2fc852d3997c3b320aceff442a1ee9b2b5ab337a87591c424",
      "text": "我一定会再来的！做出这样一家店和\n这些蛋糕，真的太感谢您了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_e:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc4723c90c9e27416e451063df50036ea4dff1b209d824efb9897cf1ff5352e7",
      "text": "好的。期待您的再次光临。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_e:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9279884c47fed3b219add5f289973f3239d2bc5d9d494de6f1b5bc1a19292e7d",
      "text": "（呼……虽然看得出非常喜欢蛋糕，\n但这势头也太猛了吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_e:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:433c0bf4206fa6ea262c855574746d2e8d2ab13d272e0023203d30cdfc3a9ddb",
      "text": "唔，怎么了？庄一郎。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_e:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6cdcd50b4dfda83dbd44939d00d66eec1c2e6966949eed4a3f825df5c54cfab",
      "text": "……呵，没什么。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_e:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be1679c9f182c2b8cdf3ebe4d8540a88c92dec35d975dba0b49b8056426dedfb",
      "text": "只是觉得最近身边聚集过来的，\n尽是些富有热情的人呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
